        <div>
          <p class="adt-body text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg069_n0033">Si &#xeb;sht&#xeb; familja bashk&#xeb;kohore?</span> <span data-id="pg069_n0034">Si merren vendimet e si ndahen p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb;?</span></p>
          <label for="item-5" class="sr-only">Si &#xeb;sht&#xeb; familja bashk&#xeb;kohore? Si merren vendimet e si ndahen p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb;?</label>
          <textarea id="item-5" data-activity-item="item-5" aria-label="Si &#xeb;sht&#xeb; familja bashk&#xeb;kohore? Si merren vendimet e si ndahen p&#xeb;rgjegj&#xeb;sit&#xeb;?" class="mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-md border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-gray-800"></textarea>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="adt-body text-gray-900"><span data-id="pg069_n0036">B&#xeb;j nj&#xeb; krahasim nd&#xeb;rmjet m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb;s se si kan&#xeb; qen&#xeb; familjet dikur dhe si jan&#xeb; sot.</span></p>
          <label for="item-6" class="sr-only">B&#xeb;j nj&#xeb; krahasim nd&#xeb;rmjet m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb;s se si kan&#xeb; qen&#xeb; familjet dikur dhe si jan&#xeb; sot.</label>
          <textarea id="item-6" data-activity-item="item-6" aria-label="B&#xeb;j nj&#xeb; krahasim nd&#xeb;rmjet m&#xeb;nyr&#xeb;s se si kan&#xeb; qen&#xeb; familjet dikur dhe si jan&#xeb; sot." class="mt-2 min-h-11 w-full rounded-md border border-purple-300 bg-white px-3 py-3 text-gray-800"></textarea>
